Z||000000||Adrift||09-11-2001||03:19 PM||||I want to prime my car myself to save some $$$, and was wondering what are the cheapest places to buy Large quantities of auto-body grade primer? I usually buy my small quantity body filler and what not from Canadian tire or WalMart (both very convient for me, living in metro TO), but would assume there are much better places to buy from. Any suggestions? Is there a significant difference between autoprimer and other primer paints? (Can I go to Home Depot and get something there?)||||reg||1
